OL,3,AProsecution to open case in Russell
OL,4,ABrand rape and sexual assault trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors are due to set out their
OL,7,Fcase against Russell Brand who is on
OL,8,Ftrial over charges of rape and sexual
OL,9,Fassault
OL,11,FThe comedian and actor, 51, has pleaded
OL,12,Fnot guilty to three counts of rape,
OL,13,Fthree counts of sexual assault and one
OL,14,Fcount of indecent assault
OL,16,FThe allegations, from six women, date
OL,17,Ffrom 1999-2009 - here's why the women
OL,18,Fwon't be named in our coverage
OL,20,FBrand arrived at court earlier -
OL,21,Falongside his wife Laura - wearing a
OL,22,Fsuit and sunglasses
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
