OL,3,AProsecution to open case in Russell
OL,4,ABrand rape and sexual assault trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to reporters, he said he felt
OL,7,F"blessed", adding: "I feel of course
OL,8,Fconcerned but hopeful this process will
OL,9,Flead to good outcomes for everybody -
OL,10,Fthat is my prayer"
OL,12,FThe trial is expected to last up to six
OL,13,Fweeks at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,14,Fcentral London
